#. module: sponsorship_switzerland
#: model:product.template,my_compassion_description:sponsorship_switzerland.product_template_fund_wtp
msgid ""
"Clean water and safe sanitation are crucial for a child's healthy "
"development. That is why Compassion is committed to building wells, "
"latrines, and sanitary facilities in Child Development Centers and local "
